      "hash": "f1ebe93d1481bf6843b95bc3532af97bf039656a0668876e21fd3bdc14888853",
      "translation": "These accessories are used with various Solidyne equipment lines that employ RJ45 audio interconnections (such as the UNIDEX and Broadcast Classisc series).\n\n<Warning>\n  Images are for illustration only. Actual products may differ in color and shape details.\n</Warning>\n\n---\n\n<Accordion title=\"RJ45 male cables\">\n  <Columns cols={3}>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 audio patch cable (STP CAT5)\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-P50.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"RJ45 audio patch cable\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**: \\\n      BAL input **YES**\\\n      BAL output **YES**\\\n      UNBAL output **YES**\n\n      STP CAT5 audio patch cable.\n\n      **Variants:**\n\n      - 2.5 m - `SOL-P25`\n      - 5 m - `SOL-P50`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 to 1 x XLR female\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-M25_1XLRF.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-M25/1XLRF\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**:\\\n      BAL input **YES**\\\n      BAL output **NO**\\\n      UNBAL output **NO**\n\n      **Use:** Balanced microphone cable.\n\n      **Length**: 2.5 m\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-M25/1XLRF`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 to 2 x XLR male\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-M25_XLRM.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-M25/XLRM\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**:\\\n      BAL input **NO**\\\n      BAL output **YES**\\\n      UNBAL output **YES**\n\n      **Length**: 2.5 m\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-M25/XLRM`\n\n      **Use:** Balanced outputs to XLR.\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 to 2 x XLR female\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-M25_XLRF.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-M25/XLRF\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**: \\\n      BAL input **YES**\\\n      BAL output **NO**\\\n      UNBAL output **NO**\n\n      **Use:** Balanced inputs to XLR.\n\n      **Length**: 2.5 m\\\n      **Code**: `SOL-M25/XLRF`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 to 2 x RCA male\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-M25_RCAM.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-M25/RCAM\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**:\\\n      BAL input **YES**\\\n      BAL output **NO**\\\n      UNBAL output **NO**\n\n      **Use:** Unbalanced inputs to RCA.\n\n      **Length**: 2.5 m\\\n      **Code**: `SOL-M25/RCAM`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 to 2 x TRS 1/4”\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-M25_TRSM.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-M25/TRSM\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**: \\\n      BAL input **YES**\\\n      BAL output **YES**\\\n      UNBAL output **YES**\n\n      **Use:** Inputs/outputs to TRS plug.\n\n      **Length**: 2.5 m\\\n      **Code**: `SOL-M25/TRSM`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 to 1 x XLR female (mic / AES-IN)\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-M12_1XLRF.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-M12/1XLRF\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**:\\\n      BAL input **YES**\\\n      BAL output **NO**\\\n      UNBAL output **NO**\n\n      **Use:** Microphone or AES-3 input.\n\n      **Length**: 1.2 m\\\n      **Code**: `SOL-M12/1XLRF`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 to 1 x XLR male (AES-OUT)\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-M12_1XLRM.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-M12/1XLRM\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**:\\\n      BAL input **NO**\\\n      BAL output **YES**\\\n      UNBAL output **NO**\n\n      **Use:** AES-3 output.\n\n      **Length**: 1.2 m\\\n      **Code**: `SOL-M12/1XLRM`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 to 2 x XLR male\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-M12_XLRM.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-M12/XLRM\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**:\\\n      BAL input **NO**\\\n      BAL output **YES**\\\n      UNBAL output **YES**\n\n      **Length**: 1.2 m\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-M12/XLRM`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 to 2 x XLR female\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-M12_XLRF.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-M12/XLRF\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**:\\\n      BAL input **YES**\\\n      BAL output **NO**\\\n      UNBAL output **NO**\n\n      **Length**: 1.2 m\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-M12/XLRF`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 to ⅛” miniplug\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-M12_minijack.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-M12/minijack\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**:\\\n      BAL input **NO**\\\n      BAL output **YES**\\\n      UNBAL output **YES**\n\n      **Use:** Unbalanced stereo output (CUE).\n\n      <Warning>\n        Not recommended for balanced inputs: leaves the (-) pin unconnected.\n      </Warning>\n      **Length**: 1.2 m\\\n      **Code**: `SOL-M12/minijack`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 to 2 x TRS female 1/4”\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-M12_TRSF.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-M12/TRSF\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**:\\\n      BAL input **YES**\\\n      BAL output **YES**\\\n      UNBAL output **YES**\n\n      **Use:** Balanced inputs/outputs with 1/4” jack.\n\n      <Note>\n        **Inputs only:** can be unbalanced using mono to RCA adapter.\n      </Note>\n      **Length**: 1.2 m\\\n      **Code**: `SOL-M12/TRSF`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 to TRS 1/4” female\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-F12_1TRSF.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-F12/1TRSF\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Compatibility**:\\\n      BAL input **YES**\\\n      BAL output **NO**\\\n      UNBAL output **NO**\n\n      **Use:** Unbalanced TRS female adapter.\n\n      **Length**: 1.2 m\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-F12/1TRSF`\n    </Card>\n  </Columns>\n</Accordion>\n\n<Accordion title=\"RJ45 female adapters (0.3 m)\">\n  <Columns cols={3}>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 female to XLR male\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-F3_1XLRM.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-F3/1XLRM\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-F3/1XLRM`\\\n      Balanced AES output.\n\n      <Note>\n        Use with SOL-P25 or SOL-P50 patch cables.\n      </Note>\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 female to XLR female\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-F3_1XLRF.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-F3/1XLRF\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-F3/1XLRF`\\\n      Balanced AES input.\n\n      <Note>\n        Use with SOL-P25 or SOL-P50 patch cables.\n      </Note>\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 female to 2 x RCA male\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-F3_RCAM.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-F3/RCAM\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-F3/RCAM`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 female to 2 x TRS male\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-F3_TRSM.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-F3/TRSM\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-F3/TRSM`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 female to 2 x XLR female\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-F3_XLRF.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-F3/XLRF\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-F3/XLRF`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 female to 2 x XLR male\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-F3_XLRM.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-F3/XLRM\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-F3/XLRM`\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"RJ45 female to ⅛” miniplug\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/SOL-F3_MINIM.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-F3/MINIM\"\n        className=\"mx-auto\"\n      />\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-F3/MINIM`\n    </Card>\n  </Columns>\n</Accordion>\n\n<Accordion title=\"Other accessories\">\n  <Columns cols={3}>\n    <Card title=\"Ethernet patch cable\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/ethernet.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"Ethernet patch cable\"\n        title=\"\"\n      />\n\n      Ethernet patch cable (not for audio).\\\n      **Length**: 1.8 m\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"D15 connector for GPIO\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/DB25_GPIO.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"D15 GPIO\"\n        title=\"\"\n      />\n\n      D15 connector without cables for GPIO.\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"TS 1/4” mono to RCA female adapter\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/TS_RCA.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"TS to RCA\"\n        title=\"\"\n      />\n\n      <Warning>\n        DO NOT USE TO CONNECT OUTPUTS.\n      </Warning>\n    </Card>\n    <Card title=\"Terminal block connection box\">\n      <img\n        src=\"/images/accesorios/RJ45_bornes.jpg\"\n        width=\"160\"\n        alt=\"SOL-F0/8TER\"\n        title=\"\"\n      />\n\n      **Code**: `SOL-F0/8TER`\n    </Card>\n  </Columns>\n</Accordion>",
